      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:4:2:61:2",
      "text": [
        " سَمِعْتُ أَبَا جَعْفَرٍ ( عليه السلام ) يَقُولُ إِنَّ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ ( صلى الله عليه وآله ) لَمْ يَصُمْ يَوْمَ عَرَفَةَ مُنْذُ نَزَلَ صِيَامُ شَهْرِ رَمَضَانَ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Muhammad Bin Yahya, from Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Ibn Fazzal, from Sa’alba Bin Maymoun, from Muhammad Bin Muslim who said, ",
          "‘I heard Abu Ja’far<sup>asws</sup> saying that Rasool-Allah<sup>saww</sup> did not Fast the day of Arafat (9<sup>th</sup> Zil Hijja) since the Fasting of the Month of Ramazan was Revealed’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "2. Muhammad ibn Yahya has narrated from Ahmad ibn Muhammad, from ibn Faddal from Tha’labah ibn Maymun from Muhammad ibn Muslim who has said the following: ““I once heard abu Ja‘far, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, say, ‘The Messenger of Allah did not fast on the day of ‘Arafah from the time fasting of the month of Ramadan came down.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
